                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJyQU1ZgWsQjQR5kN2WtEzKtU/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURfZ05mallBEAE",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Restaurant Page - it’s our 3rd time here.\n\nSo - to skip to the key points.\nYes, it is definitely a good place to bring your friends, you will never make a mistake here.\n\nYes the salad is fresh, we tried 2 types and they are so delicious.\n\nYes their risottos are also great ! Scallops cooked perfectly.\n\nYes their duck breast is really worth it ! Highly recommend , so tender and the pickles on the side just accentuates it.\n\nAnd yes, the pork ribs are also tender and juicy.\n\nService is also pretty good, the folks in Restaurant page ensure you have water once you take your seat. They are so attentive.\n\nBecause the place is not that big, it is definitely not a place where you can enjoy a quiet lunch or dinner , given everyone’s enjoying their food. So if you like your food in a quiet place ; this may not be a good place for you. But if you want to enjoy the food , go ahead!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "Restaurant Page - it’s our 3rd time here.\n\nSo - to skip to the key points.\nYes, it is definitely a good place to bring your friends, you will never make a mistake here.\n\nYes the salad is fresh, we tried 2 types and they are so delicious.\n\nYes their risottos are also great ! Scallops cooked perfectly.\n\nYes their duck breast is really worth it ! Highly recommend , so tender and the pickles on the side just accentuates it.\n\nAnd yes, the pork ribs are also tender and juicy.\n\nService is also pretty good, the folks in Restaurant page ensure you have water once you take your seat. They are so attentive.\n\nBecause the place is not that big, it is definitely not a place where you can enjoy a quiet lunch or dinner , given everyone’s enjoying their food. So if you like your food in a quiet place ; this may not be a good place for you. But if you want to enjoy the food , go ahead!",
                                             "languageCode":  "en"
                                         },
